      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠥᠺᠡᠨᠡᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>tökenekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>төөнөх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TØGENE-</transcript>
      <definition>v.t. To cauterize, apply a poultice or a hot compress.</definition>
      <page>832</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠯᠠᠭᠤᠨ ᠳᠠᠪᠤᠰᠤᠨ ᠢᠶᠠᠷ ᠲᠥᠺᠡᠨᠡᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>xalaγun dabusun ijer --ky</transcript>
          <definition> To apply hot salt to a part of the body affected by an ailment</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠯᠠᠭᠤᠨ ᠶᠠᠭᠤᠮ᠎ᠠ ᠪᠡᠷ ᠲᠥᠺᠡᠨᠡᠵᠦ ᠵᠢᠩ ᠪᠠᠷᠢᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>xalaγun jaγum-a ber --zy zing barixu</transcript>
          <definition> To apply a hot object to a part of the body affected by an ailment.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
